# intPrep agent rule

This repo is a **frontend interview prep** workspace (JS, CSS, Angular, system design, scenarios, practice apps).

## On every new chat (especially after clone)

1. Read root `AGENTS.md` and `CHAT_CONTEXT.md` before large changes.
2. Prefer extending existing guides via each folder’s `INDEX.md` — don’t duplicate topics.
3. Practice app: `prevonir-interview-practice/` (`npm i && npm start`). Keep machine-coding **interview-simple**.
4. q8 file explorer uses **local `isOpen`** on purpose; don’t “upgrade” to lifted Set unless asked.
5. User wants deep explanations, examples, tradeoffs, and short spoken answers.
6. **GOC (Google Operations Center) FE Senior Specialist** → `goc/INDEX.md`. Separate from OneTrust (`onetrust/`). Do not mix those interviews.

Full decision log and artifact inventory: `CHAT_CONTEXT.md`.
